<title>USA: Westmark, Medical close agreement.</title>
<headline>Westmark, Medical close agreement.</headline>
<dateline>DELRAY BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westmark Group Holdings Inc said Wednesday it has closed an amendment to its stock and debt settlement agreement with Medical Industries of America Inc.</p>
<p>The amendment concerns certain debt and equity investments which have been made by Medical Industries in Westmark.</p>
<p>The amendment provides for an orderly schedule of payment on Westmark's indebtedness to Medical Industries, with certain beneficial pre-payment parameters.</p>
<p>The restructured agreement also lengthens the amortization on Westmark's note, thereby lowering Westmark's monthly cost basis by converting Westmark's largest single block of corporate debt from short-term to long-term notes.</p>
<p>Westmark made its first payment on June 30th.</p>
</text>
